-------------------------------------------------------------------------------

      Welcome to OLMS - an extremely powerful, yet simple to use, mail door.
      After answering the next couple of questions, you are set to configure
      your message areas, keywords and filters to make the most of your time
      on the system.  Just imagine, no more sifting through thousands of the
      messages online  -  you can pick some good filters and keywords,  then
      enjoy smaller packets without the boring messages you don't want to be
      bothered with.

      If you have not previously been much involved with the message bases,
      the first download you make might take a little while,   depending on
      how many messages are currently active. Would you like to reset these
      areas for only the most recent messages?   (This could save you a lot
      of time the first time through)

-------------------------------------------------------------------------------

            Press Space to Continue, or "F" for Fast First Scanning
